<title>TURKEY: Turk Tupras buys 55kt gasoline from Glencore, Poten.</title>
<headline>Turk Tupras buys 55kt gasoline from Glencore, Poten.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery, Tupras, said it had bought 30,000 tonnes of gasoline from Glencore and 25,000 tonnes of the same from Poten company through a tender.</p>
<p>It said the import from Glencore was priced at a discount of minus $12.75 per tonne and will be delivered on June 20-22.</p>
<p>The Poten purchase was at minus $9.9 per tonne and the delivery will be on June 19-21.</p>
<p>The tender was held on June 4, it said.</p>
<p>--Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
